abstract: >-
  The "werkraum" ("work room") is the precursor platform of the
  AI4ArtsEd AI Lab: a SwarmUI-based software framework for critical
  educational and scientific exploration and manipulation of
  generative AI, developed for cultural-aesthetic education. Its
  session-archive architecture is documented in the 2025 interim
  report of the research project AI4ArtsEd.
